      "title": "University Published Paper Reproducibility Assessment Protocol - For Teachers v1",
      "abstract": "<p>This protocol is for teachers to set up a data curation exercise for their students. Using a universities IR or CRIS to select papers that their researchers have published, and then assign them to students to see if the data availability meets the national, funder, university and journal policies. The students carrying out this assessment have a separate related protocol they need to follow. </p>",
